|CKBNecro|000

|CK0Necros are physically fragile death-mages who combine destructive spells,
curses, runes, battlefield control, and undead followers. They rely on magical
preparation and minion management rather than ordinary armour and weapons.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Two personal runes support the Necro's spell catalog and supernatural power.
The guild can raise and direct undead, spread diseases and curses, protect
itself with deathly wards, and escalate a fight through rituals and sustained
spell pressure.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0nraise creates an undead follower, nliege and nmarch direct minions,
ncurse, npox, nfester, and nplague weaken enemies, nburst and ndeath provide
damage, nbshield and nward defend the caster, and nritual prepares deeper
necromancy.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Necro if you enjoy caster fragility, commanding followers, combining
afflictions, and managing a dangerous toolkit whose strength comes from death
rather than direct martial durability.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBnechelp intro|CK0, |CKBnechelp spell|CK0, and
|CKBnechelp follower|CK0 for the full grimoire.|000

